WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.399 --> 00:00:04.500
MEG or magnetoencephalography has been used

00:00:04.500 --> 00:00:08.260
for decades to map brain function in realtime.

00:00:08.260 --> 00:00:10.570
It does so by measuring magnetic fields created

00:00:10.570 --> 00:00:12.690
by electrical currents in the brain.

00:00:12.690 --> 00:00:15.530
But conventional machines are large, heavy,

00:00:15.530 --> 00:00:18.330
and require the patient to stay very still.

00:00:18.330 --> 00:00:21.420
As a result, some people can’t use traditional

00:00:21.420 --> 00:00:24.619
MEG machines like young children with epilepsy

00:00:24.619 --> 00:00:27.609
or patients with tremors caused by neurodegenerative

00:00:27.609 --> 00:00:29.730
diseases like Parkinson’s.

00:00:29.730 --> 00:00:32.169
Now, researchers have created a scanner

00:00:32.169 --> 00:00:34.200
that can be worn like a helmet.

00:00:34.200 --> 00:00:36.040
The advance comes from new sensors

00:00:36.040 --> 00:00:39.220
that can work at room temperature.

00:00:39.220 --> 00:00:41.340
This sheds the bulky weight of cooling technology

00:00:41.340 --> 00:00:44.520
required for the sensors in conventional systems.

00:00:44.520 --> 00:00:46.540
And the helmet-mounted sensors are much closer

00:00:46.540 --> 00:00:49.120
to the brain so the signal they can pick up

00:00:49.120 --> 00:00:51.330
is greatly increased.

00:00:51.330 --> 00:00:52.610
Researchers demonstrated that they could measure

00:00:52.610 --> 00:00:55.100
brain activity while people moved naturally

00:00:55.100 --> 00:00:58.850
in various ways, from drinking fluids

00:00:58.850 --> 00:01:01.620
to even playing paddle ball.

00:01:01.620 --> 00:01:04.570
However, the device’s sensors only work when

00:01:04.570 --> 00:01:06.830
the earth’s magnetic field has been reduced

00:01:06.830 --> 00:01:09.900
by a factor of about 50,000.

00:01:09.900 --> 00:01:12.260
So the team developed panels consisting of

00:01:12.260 --> 00:01:16.000
special electromagnetic coils, which help to reduce

00:01:16.000 --> 00:01:19.740
the earth’s magnetic field around the scanner.

00:01:19.740 --> 00:01:21.030
Researchers are now working to shrink

00:01:21.030 --> 00:01:24.490
the helmet design for children and even babies.

00:01:24.490 --> 00:01:26.880
They hope this technology will be to better understand

00:01:26.880 --> 00:01:28.820
cognition and brain development--

00:01:28.820 --> 00:01:30.360
Leading to more accurate treatments

00:01:30.360 --> 00:01:32.580
and earlier diagnoses for all patients--

00:01:32.760 --> 00:01:34.800
especially those with neurological,

00:01:34.810 --> 00:01:36.990
neurodegenerative, and mental health conditions.

